      "title": "Joseph Fracchia, The Philosophical Leninism and Eastern 'Western Marxism' of Georg Luk\u00e1cs",
      "url": "https://philpapers.org/rec/FRATPL",
      "philpapers_id": "FRATPL",
      "snippet": "Luk\u00e1cs is generally heralded as a founding theoretician of a \u2018Western Marxism\u2019, in opposition to \u2018Eastern\u2019 Soviet Marxism, and his most impressive and most influential work, History and Class Consciousness, is generally treated as having rehabilitated Marxist concern with questions of subjectivity.",
      "page_age": null,
